    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Nursa Public API lets healthcare facilities and their scheduling/workforce systems post and manage per diem shifts on the Nursa marketplace, review clinician shift requests, schedule clinicians, handle shift reports and cancellations, read clinician credentials, and subscribe to webhooks.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Nursa API Team\n Email: josh.bear@nursa.com",
